OL,3,AAnti-homosexuality laws in Trinidad and
OL,4,ATobago overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK court has overturned laws
OL,7,Fcriminalising same-sex intimacy in
OL,8,FTrinidad and Tobago.
OL,10,FLondon's Judicial Committee of the
OL,11,FPrivy Council (JCPC), the Caribbean
OL,12,Fisland's final court of appeal, ruled
OL,13,Fthe laws were not in keeping with the
OL,14,F"fundamental individual right to
OL,15,Frespect for private and family life."
OL,17,FThe judgement is the result of an
OL,18,F11-year legal battle brought by
OL,19,Fdual-citizen Jason Jones, 62, who said
OL,20,Fhe hoped it would "accelerate the fight
OL,21,Ffor full equality."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
