OL,3,AAnti-homosexuality laws in Trinidad and
OL,4,ATobago overturned
OL,5,
OL,6,FJones had successfully challenged the
OL,7,Flaws in 2018 in Trinidad's High Court,
OL,8,Fhowever the ruling was overturned on
OL,9,Fappeal by the Trinidadian government.
